; terrain textures (docs/ART.md 5.1-5.2): seamless 64x64, sampled in map space through the domain warp.
; Bright, readable ground: a clear base, soft dithered variation, small lit marks (tufts, flowers, dune and
; wave crests). Hell terrains are their twin's layout recoloured. Baked by the revamp's texture recipes.

